# --- Publish 2026-10-20 exceptions -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# pilot-v1 (already public since e59d8e1): raw/ (read-only copies, checked by raw_SHA256SUMS), analysis.json and the
# pilot summaries were tracked before; analysis_placebo_fix.json (placebo-fix re-analysis, reproduced by
# tests/test_reviewer_followups.py via `analysis --legacy-pilot-v1`) is new. The top-level calls/judgments/ledger/state
# files in this folder are byte-identical duplicates of raw/ and stay ignored; rejudge_*_state.json stays ignored
# (judge re-run state; rejudge_hedging_v3_state.json contains the held constructed letters).
!runs/20261012T143812-ff54324d-4745d6-batch/
runs/20261012T143812-ff54324d-4745d6-batch/*
!runs/20261012T143812-ff54324d-4745d6-batch/raw/
!runs/20261012T143812-ff54324d-4745d6-batch/raw_SHA256SUMS
